# GetFinance — Pluggy credentials + connected bank items.
#
# 1. Copy this file to ".env" in the SAME folder:   copy .env.example .env
# 2. Fill in your own values (no quotes needed).
#
# Where these come from (see step 3 of the README onboarding, and
# ../../docs/getfinance-pluggy-integration.md for the deep version):
#
#   CLIENT_ID / CLIENT_SECRET  -> your Pluggy "Development Application" keys,
#                                 from https://dashboard.pluggy.ai
#   ITEM_IDS                   -> the UUID of each bank connection ("item") you
#                                 linked. One per bank; comma-separate several:
#                                 ITEM_IDS=00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001,00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002

CLIENT_ID=
CLIENT_SECRET=
ITEM_IDS=
